messages.content:
Build a live sales overview widget for Uno Platform:
- a card titled "Sales overview" with a blinking LIVE indicator;
- a 12 by 8 heatmap of cells in the brand colour that shift in intensity all the time;
- monthly and yearly sales totals, each with its change as an up or down percentage;
- a "Top regions" list: Los Angeles, New York and Canada, each with its total and change;
- a new sales snapshot every two seconds, with the numbers easing to the new values instead of jumping;
- a loading state before the first snapshot, a card that fits a phone screen, and every colour and size from the app theme.

Stack: Uno Platform single project, MVUX with a FeedView, Navigation Extensions, Toolkit, Material; desktop, WebAssembly and Android.
